              highlighted: ["EB","FD","AB","CD"],
              justifications: [{ ref: "VII.7" }, { ref: "VII.8" }] },
            { text: "Therefore {EB} is to {FD} as {AB} is to {CD}.",
              visible: GIVEN,
              highlighted: ["EB","FD","AB","CD"],
              justifications: [{ ref: "VII.Def.20" }] },
            { text: "Therefore, if a whole is to a whole as a subtracted number is to a subtracted number,",
              visible: GIVEN,
              highlighted: ["AB","CD","AE","CF"] },
